cution, vowed he wouldn't testify when served a subpoena last week.","question":"Was Greg Anderson asked to testify?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":79,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Owls are more flexible than humans because a bird's head is only connected by one socket pivot.","question":"Are humans less flexible than owls?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":80,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Even in the same animal, not all bites are the same.","question":"For a given animal, can you expect that some bites have different intensity?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":81,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Buck did not like it, but he bore up well to the work, taking pride in it.","question":"How did Buck deal with his job?","options":"He quit|He carried on","list":"n","item_id":82,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"He carried on"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"These days, neuroscience is beginning to catch up to musicians who practice mentally.","question":"Is neuroscience making progress in understanding how musicians can practice mentally?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":83,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Hybrid vehicles have a halo that makes owners feel righteous and their neighbors feel guilty for not doing as much to save the planet.","question":"Why would the neighbors feel inferior?","options":"They are not as rich|Their cars are not as eco-friendly","list":"n","item_id":84,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Their cars are not as eco-friendly"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Binge drinking may not necessarily kill or even damage brain cells, as commonly thought, a new animal study suggests.","question":"What do most people think about binge drinking?","options":"It may not damage brain cells|It damages brain cells.","list":"n","item_id"