ss a risk factor for depression, but not anxiety?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":92,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"When it comes to having a lasting and fulfilling relationship, common wisdom says that feeling close to your romantic partner is paramount.","question":"Does common wisdom emphasize a healthy distance to maintain a lasting relationship?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":93,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Voltaire himself probably won around half a million livres, a large fortune, which he then made even larger.","question":"Was half a million livres considered a significant amount of money?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":94,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"When preparing to check out of their hotel room, some frequent travelers pile up their used bath towels on the bathroom floor.","question":"Do frequent travellers sometimes pile clean bath towels on the bathroom floor before checking out of a hotel?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":95,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Research showing that a tiny European river bug called the water boatman may be the loudest animal on earth has some intersting sidebars.","question":"What makes water boatman distinctive?","options":"Its size|Its sound","list":"n","item_id":96,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Its sound"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"When the new world was first discovered it was found to be, like the old, well stocked with plants and animals.","question":"Was the old world well stocked with plants and animals?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":97,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Police in Georgia have shut down a lemonade stand run by three girls trying to save up for a trip to a water park.","question":"What was sold at the stand that was shut-down?","options":"Lemonade|Fruit","list":"n","item_id":98,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Lemonade"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"An early task will be to make sure the newfound microbes were not introduced while drilling through the ice into the lake.","question":"When in the process should we determine whether microbes were introduced?","options":"Late|Early","list":"n","item_id":99,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Early"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Lady Gaga's YouTube account was suspended Thursday.","question":"What account was suspended on Thursday?","options":"Lady Gaga's Youtube|Lady Gaga's Instagram","list":"n","item_id":100,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Lady Gaga's Youtube"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"John Thornton asked little of man or nature.","question":"Did John Thorton expect a lot from other people?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":101,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Proper ventilation will make a backdraft less likely.","question":"Would proper ventilation reduce backdraft?","options":"Yes|No","list":"n","item_id":102,"block":2,"RNDM":"FILLER1","correct":"Yes"}]