 the area?","options":"Blizzard|Drought","list":"j","item_id":109,"block":3,"RNDM":"FILLER2","correct":"Blizzard"},{"condition_id":"FILLER2","text":"Steam sterilization is limited in the types of medical waste it can treat, but is appropriate for laboratory substances.","question":"What is steam sterilization good for?","options":"Any waste|Lab waste","list":"j","item_id":110,"block":3,"RNDM":"FILLER2","correct":"Lab waste"},{"condition_id":"FILLER2","text":"From coal to cars, Chinese floods tangle supply chains worldwide.","question":"Do the floods have a global economic effect?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":111,"block":3,"RNDM":"FILLER2","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"FILLER2","text":"This new film marks 10 years since the death of the superstar.","question":"How long has the artist passed away?","options":"For only a few years|For about a decade","list":"j","item_id":112,"block":3,"RNDM":"FILLER2","correct":"For about a decade"}]